    - target: {fileID: 4278893004508024768, guid: 6b6441ddfd0d4fa47b9986c7113d14f2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Once upon a time, there was a man in a very small square-shaped room.
        He couldn't remember what happened, his name, or his story. \n\nThe room
        was very enclosed and dim. There were objects that could be interacted with.
        Each object interacted with would change the scene to a memory experienced
        by the man. \n\nThe more he interacted with an object, the more it became
        clear why he was trapped in that place.\n\nPress Q to escape"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
